  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \r\nIt $\\left.\\frac{x \\sin x-3(1-\\cos x)}{3 x^{k}}=\\frac{1}{3} \\operatorname{lt}_{x \\rightarrow 0}\\left(\\frac{\\sin x / 2}{x / 2}\\right)_{x \\rightarrow 0} \\mid t_{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{2 x \\cos x / 2-6 \\sin x / 2}{2 x^{k-1}}\\right)$\r\n$k-1=1 \\Rightarrow k=2$",
